### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Initialize / Set Stock for MacBook Pro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stocks
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
  "branchCode": "MAIN",
  "quantity": 50
}

### 2. Get All Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stocks
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Stock by SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stocks/LAPTOP-MBP-14?branchCode=MAIN
Accept: application/json

### 4. Manually Add Stock (Restock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stocks/add
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
  "branchCode": "MAIN",
  "quantity": 10,
  "reason": "New supplier delivery"
}

### 5. Manually Deduct Stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stocks/deduct
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
  "branchCode": "MAIN",
  "quantity": 2,
  "reason": "Manual stock adjustment"
}
